<name>P-1616 Lot 4 - FITTED v5 (operator drag-fit)</name>
<description>FITTED POSITION v5 (2026-09-06): corner 1 at 14.253992 N, 122.713686 E
(14d15'14.37"N 122d42'49.27"E) - OPERATOR DRAG-FIT in Google Earth Pro (Jonathan/team,
matching the 1:2,000 Progress Map overlay to terrain). Independently validated: running the
title's tie line back (S60-30'E, 3,508.83 m) lands the implied BLBM No.1 INSIDE Brgy.
Batobalani, 536 m from its published reference point - the fit and the title agree. Parcel is
in modern Brgy. Santa Rosa Sur (1963 "San Rafael"). Shape exact from OCT technical description
(closure 0.07 m). Est. accuracy: the drag-fit's, ~100-200 m. Final survey-grade fix: DENR/LMS
data or GPS on monumented corners 8-11. Orientation is true-north per the title bearings - do
not rotate.</description>
